606","id":3593120668,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7WKquc","user":{"login":"pescador-barquero","id":203863694,"node_id":"U_kgDODCa2jg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/203863694?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pescador-barquero","html_url":"https://github.com/pescador-barquero","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pescador-barquero/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pescador-barquero/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pescador-barquero/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pescador-barquero/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pescador-barquero/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pescador-barquero/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pescador-barquero/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pescador-barquero/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pescador-barquero/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-30T19:02:38Z","updated_at":"2025-11-30T19:02:38Z","body":"I had the intent of creating a pull request for current master but new build problems emerged. Maybe at a later date. Meanwhile you can check the patch for branch 4.5 [here](https://github.com/pescador-barquero/godot/tree/freebsd-build).\n```\n[  4%] Compiling platform/linuxbsd/wayland/egl_manager_wayland.cpp ...\nplatform/linuxbsd/wayland/wayland_embedder.cpp:687:73: error: use of undeclared identifier 'CMSG_ALIGN'\n  687 |                 msg.msg_control = Memory::alloc_aligned_static(CMSG_SPACE(data_size), CMSG_ALIGN(1));\n      |                                                                                       ^\nplatform/linuxbsd/wayland/wayland_embedder.cpp:2870:16: error: variable has incomplete type 'struct ucred'\n 2870 |                 struct ucred cred = {};\n      |                              ^\nplatform/linuxbsd/wayland/wayland_embedder.cpp:2870:10: note: forward declaration of 'ucred'\n 2870 |                 struct ucred cred = {};\n      |                        ^\nplatform/linuxbsd/wayland/wayland_embedder.cpp:2872:34: error: use of undeclared identifier 'SO_PEERCRED'\n 2872 |                 getsockopt(new_fd, SOL_SOCKET, SO_PEERCRED, &cred, &cred_size);\n      |                                                ^\n3 errors generated.\n```","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3593120668/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3593144563","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110606#issuecomment-3593144563","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110606","id":3593144563,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7WKwjz","user":{"login":"pescador-barquero","id":203863694,"node_id":"U_kgDODCa2jg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/203863694?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pescador-barquero","html_url":"https://github.com/pescador-barquero","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pescador-barquero/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pescador-barquero/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pescador-barquero/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pescador-barquero/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pescador-barquero/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pescador-barquero/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pescador-barquero/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pescador-barquero/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pescador-barquero/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-30T19:13:40Z","updated_at":"2025-11-30T19:14:35Z","body":"The defines CMSG_ALIGN CMSG_SPACE are present in a header that wayland_embeder.cpp already includes, however their definitions are skipped behind a `#ifdef _KERNEL` check. This is above my expertise but it seems to be another Linux-specific situation in Godot.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3593144563/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]